 "\nHowever, if a single unit cube is removed from the middle of one of the \
cube faces, the symmetry will be reduced and there will be six placement \
possibilities and six rows. This is because the face with the missing unit \
cube could be rotated so that it is on any of the six faces of the empty \
3x3x3 cube space. \n",
