 "\nIf one cube is removed from the middle of a cube face and one is removed \
from a corner, the cube will have no symmetry and will add 24 rows to the \
matrix. The missing face cube could be on any of the six faces of the empty \
cube and this is multiplied by the four corners of that face where the \
missing corner could be located. \n",
