  3.9444972836445236`*^9, 3.9444972843085575`*^9}},
 CellID->4291809,ExpressionUUID->"13cb9e57-d24c-de48-a4ed-a0a7d8bd3d48"],

Cell["\<\
This section provides the code for a polycube puzzle solver in Mathematica \
with a graphical user interface.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.944489699996242*^9, 3.944489721114878*^9}, {
  3.944490172471438*^9, 3.944490213850998*^9}},
 CellID->24102116,ExpressionUUID->"f5ae6de8-dedf-9d4b-8c14-0fd5247f9a0e"],

Cell["\<\
The FindExactCover resource function will find an exact cover for the \
occupancy matrix once it has been created. It uses DLX for this by default. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9444902919546432`*^9, 3.944490402253441*^9}},
 CellID->335221542,ExpressionUUID->"8b42f5de-9626-c340-9aaa-eaf66bd84fc5"],

