Cell["\<\
The createOccupancyMatrix function creates the complete occupancy matrix \
including the one-hot vector. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.944492713148239*^9, {3.944492915370476*^9, 3.944492936873436*^9}, {
